c.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/2899ed334d700f4294dabbb93b8969d3.webm?t=1750391282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/2899ed334d700f4294dabbb93b8969d3.mp4?t=1750391282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression for Long-Term Strategy</strong><br>Earn unlocks between runs to bolster your starting forces with small, stackable boosts that apply across all games. Each run brings you closer to ultimate victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/47d870a7c1a1a2553cb0c97bffd8a4a6.poster.avif?t=1750391282\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/47d870a7c1a1a2553cb0c97bffd8a4a6.webm?t=1750391282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/47d870a7c1a1a2553cb0c97bffd8a4a6.mp4?t=1750391282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World War II Atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the gritty environments and iconic weaponry of World War II, all brought to life with a distinct art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/963f19198f781a7b935ed296bac1ff0b.poster.avif?t=1750391282\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/963f19198f781a7b935ed296bac1ff0b.webm?t=1750391282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/963f19198f781a7b935ed296bac1ff0b.mp4?t=1750391282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong><br>Have fun with custom battles deploying as many troops as you'd like to in epic or completely pitched engagements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/7805a75bd828a3e2c2b82e3ddb35ad83.poster.avif?t=1750391282\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/7805a75bd828a3e2c2b82e3ddb35ad83.webm?t=1750391282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222240/extras/7805a75bd828a3e2c2b82e3ddb35ad83.mp4?t=1750391282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How Long Can You Hold the Line?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to the challenge and lead your battalion to victory, or will the relentless enemy waves crush your resolve? <strong>Rogue Battalion</strong> offers endless replayability with ever-evolving strategies and a satisfying mix of tactical combat and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a commander. Build your army. Upgrade your forces. Form up your troops. Win the war!</p>",
